-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;margin-top:16px;font-weight:500;font-size:15px\">Stablecoin payments in Togo for businesses →</a><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/fr/envoyer-de-l-argent-au-togo\">Lire en français →</a></p><p style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6E6C8A;margin:20px 0 0\">Updated October 2026</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px\"><div style=\"padding:24px;border-radius:24px;background:#131126;color:#F6F4EF\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#B4B1D0\">QUICK ANSWER</div><p style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:28px;margin:12px 0 0\">The fastest way for a business to send money to Togo is a direct payout to Moov Money in XOF. With ElementPay it is sent on local rails with the rate and fee shown upfront, funded from fiat or stablecoins.</p></div><div style=\"border-radius:24px;background:#F6F4EF;padding:8px;display:grid;gap:4px\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Currency</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">XOF · West African CFA franc</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6E6C8A;flex:none\">Payout rails</span><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;text-align:right\">Moov Money and Mixx by Yas</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--fon